  "brief_rationale": "The doctor immediately escalated the post-PCI syncope episode, elicited current status and red flags, integrated incomplete results and medication uncertainty, gave concrete transport/waiting instructions, and obtained family receipt that 120 was called and records/medications were handed over. No responsibility-chain item was missed or incorrectly handled. The closure correctly distinguished a safe transition from unresolved diagnostic questions and residual risks, and the model actively navigated the real-world barrier of the patient minimizing his symptoms. Two high-order points (HO1 and HO2) were fully completed with meaningful trajectory impact.",
