          "quote": "我们已经按您说的打了120，地址也报了，现在在等车"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 requires navigating practical barriers that could delay urgent assessment. The family surfaced that the patient was minimizing symptoms and refusing to go, and the doctor explicitly addressed this by telling the family not to cancel 120, offering a feasible escalation path (calling 120, using ambulance transport), and confirming that the family would use that path.",
