          "explanation": "Doctor asks about current status including consciousness, chest symptoms, and whether 120 was called.",
          "quote": "他现在是否仍胸闷/头晕，意识是否清楚，是否已拨120？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "Family reports that the patient is conscious, still has chest discomfort, and that 120 has been called.",
